# 不带尾斜杠：`node_modules/` 只匹配目录，而本仓有三处 node_modules 是软链
# （根、packages/core、以及任何被 `git add -A` 扫进来的工作树软链）。软链在 git
# 眼里不是目录，尾斜杠规则对它不生效 —— 2026-11-14 22:26 与 23:45 两次就是同一
# 个坑：`node_modules -> /Users/<operator>/...` 被提交进干线，随后**出片脚本整条
# 挂死**（tar 解出来的是软链，禁品扫描把它当文件 read，报 EISDIR 且不点名路径）。
node_modules
.DS_Store
mcp.json
registry-groups.json
knowledge-store/
data/
# Env files: the live .env holds Logto/registry/LLM credentials; variants
# (.bak, .local, dated backups…) are operator copies of the same secrets.
# Keep the committed .env.example template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env.bak*
*.bak
*.bak-*

# React frontend workspace
web/node_modules/
# 素材广场导出产物：scripts/plaza-export.mjs 每次 deploy-plaza.sh / CI 都重新生成
# （deploy-plaza.sh 第 ① 步就是 export）。追踪它 = 每次导出制造几百个 diff 噪声
# （2026-11-23 实测 794 个脏文件）。CI 用 upload-artifact 留审计快照，不靠 git。
site-plaza/generated/
web/dist/

# Shared core: `packages/core/node_modules` is a symlink onto web/node_modules
# (see scripts/postinstall-web.js) so the shared source resolves zustand/react
# to exactly one instance. The root `node_modules` rule above (no trailing
# slash) already covers it; kept explicit as documentation of why it must not
# be a trailing-slash rule.
packages/core/node_modules

# WeChat mini-program client (Taro)
miniapp/node_modules/
miniapp/dist/

# Electron build artifacts
dist/
# build/ contents are gitignored except the vendored default icon
# (deployment-branding); the ICON_URL download stays ignored (build-local,
# fork-specific). 'build/*' + negation, not 'build/': a directory rule
# excludes everything beneath it unconditionally.
build/*
!build/icon.png
resources/node/
resources/openconnector/
# Keep original tarballs out of the repo
resources/node/*.tar.gz

# Local runtime stores
chat-history-store/
documents-store/
sessions-store/
cron-store/
/uploads/
knowledge-store.archive/
test-results/
# DB custom-skill materialization dir (runtime artifact; rebuilt from the DB)
custom-skills/
# Hosted-gateway per-user cell roots (CELL_DATA_ROOT default; one dir per user)
cell-data/

# Headless local-services launcher dev state (generated creds, written under
# PLATFORM_DATA_DIR / CWD by bootstrap/first-run.js).
dev-settings.json
openconnector.db
# Runtime LLM provider/default stores (contain upstream API keys in plaintext)
llm-providers.json
llm-default.json
# dsh-credentials-local credential store (upstream API keys, 0600)
.credentials.yaml

# Local Playwright CLI console logs (scratch)
.playwright-cli/
web/.playwright-cli/

# SSH / remote-infra scratch (docker-compose for the tokenvault IDP deployment;
# references env-held secrets but is private infra, not part of this app)
.remote-dc.yml
.remote-dc-current.yml
.tmp-testpw-hash
sso-test.mjs
connect-app/
.zcode/
.mcp.json

# Local AI tooling copies (per-machine; not part of the app)
.claude/skills/
# Claude/ZCode worktree scratch dirs — a committed gitlink here breaks
# actions/checkout's submodule cleanup ("No url found for submodule path").
.claude/worktrees/

# Impeccable live-mode session journals (local iteration state)
.impeccable/live/
# Impeccable local render evidence (screenshots / detector scratch). The design
# records (surfaces/, design.json) stay tracked; review captures are local only.
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/hook.cache.json

# Scratch temp files
.tmp-*
*.local.log
.e2e-store-*/

# Runtime-generated auth material. `resolveSessionSecret()` writes
# ./auth/session-secret whenever PLATFORM_DATA_DIR is unset (dev runs), so this
# dir appears in the working tree after any local `npm start`. Anchored to the
# repo root on purpose: a bare `auth/` also matched openspec/specs/auth/ and
# every openspec change's specs/auth/ delta, silently untracking them.
/auth/
# Deployment scratch (image build contexts / live-pod patches)
.platform-*.tar.gz

# websearch relay (services/search-relay) — operator-side, never commit
services/search-relay/keys.json

# Editor swap files and agent-collaboration working notes — not software, never pushed
*.swp
docs/agents/
CLAUDE.md

# codegraph local index (tool data, not source)
.codegraph/

# Open-source snapshot build output (scripts/make-public-snapshot.mjs)
dist-opensource/

# npm pack artifacts (facet CLI)
*.tgz

# Python build artifacts (doc-studio sample generator)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# local trace db (runtime artifact, never a source file)
trace.db
trace.db-shm
trace.db-wal

# local gui test artifacts
/gui-test-screenshots/

# generated code-graph artifacts (graphify). 115MB / ~4800 files that record
# whole-repo paths, so any public snapshot containing them trips the leak scan.
# NOTE: .gitignore only affects UNTRACKED files. On the local fork line these
# are already committed (came in with a merged mirror snapshot), so ignoring
# them here does NOT untrack them — the snapshot-side guard is
# "graphify-out/" in scripts/make-public-snapshot.mjs EXCLUDE_PATHS, verified by
# scripts/verify-snapshot-exclusions.mjs.
#
# 2026-11-24: the tracked copies were removed from the INDEX
# (openspec: purge-tracked-codegraph-output); the files stay on disk. Two
# consequences:
#   · pull after that commit -> ~4,811 "deleted" lines. That is expected; the
#     checkout stops materializing them, which was the whole point.
#   · if pull is REFUSED because of local edits under graphify-out/ (should not
#     happen — it is generated), run `rm -rf graphify-out && git pull`.
# Guard: scripts/check-tracked-artifacts.mjs fails if the path returns to the
# index. Do not `git add -f` this directory.
graphify-out/

# 本地草稿：本仓 issue tracker 是 GitHub issues（docs/agents/issue-tracker.md），
# 工作区根惯例的 .scratch/（含 UI 审计截图）不属于本仓；reports/ 是结项报告产物。
# 2026-11-23：两者从未被追踪（git ls-files = 0），一直以未跟踪形式污染 git status。
.scratch/
reports/
